  "description": "Expose your existing ASP.NET Core Web API to AI agents as Model Context Protocol (MCP) tools. Mark a controller action or minimal-API handler with [McpTool] and a Roslyn source generator emits the MCP tool class at build time, on top of the official ModelContextProtocol.AspNetCore SDK. Includes token-efficient output shaping, auth header forwarding, per-tool OAuth scope gates, safety hints from HTTP verbs, a tool-manifest hash for drift detection, an offline search_tools meta-tool, and llms.txt / MCP Server Card discovery documents. One package brings the attributes, the generator, and the MCP server SDK. Targets .NET 8, 9, and 10.",
